### Starvation Testing
- Generate continuous high-priority load and monitor normal task processing
- Verify aging mechanism promotes aged normal tasks
- Measure maximum wait time for normal tasks under sustained high load

### Graceful Shutdown Testing
- Initiate shutdown while tasks are processing
- Verify all in-flight tasks complete before worker termination
- Test with producers blocked on backpressure
- Confirm no resource leaks or deadlocks

